  "activation": "Only unqueried JSON windows with 8 * limit < inventory size; saturating multiplication. This is a conservative window-size heuristic, not a measured CPU crossover.",
  "contract": "Metadata rank keys and original ordinals reproduce stable ties. Descending applies the existing existence filter while pulling ranked candidates; ascending selects newest K then reverses before that filter. Queried JSON, text exact totals and wide windows retain full sorting.",
